  ('00000000-0000-4000-b023-000000000010', '00000000-0000-4000-9001-000000000023', 'Go-live – final decision (point of no return)', 'Sunday 18:00 decision to go live or roll back.', 'pending', $j${"checkpoint_reference":"GNG-10","cutover_event":"go_live","cutover_phase":"go_live","sequence":10,"scheduled_at":"2027-04-11T18:00:00.000Z","decision_forum":"Cutover board with executive sponsor","chair":"Grace Moyo","criteria":"Every earlier checkpoint passed\tCutover manager\tNot assessed\tGo/No-Go register\nBusiness verification signed off\tBusiness readiness lead\tNot assessed\tCutover Sign-Off\nRollback still possible\tTechnical lead\tNot assessed\tRollback Plan"}$j$),
  ('00000000-0000-4000-b024-000000000001', '00000000-0000-4000-9001-000000000024', 'Rollback Plan – Core Banking Go-Live', 'How the bank returns to the legacy core banking system if the go-live weekend has to be abandoned before the point of no return.', 'draft', $j${"document_reference":"RB-PLN-001","document_version":"0.3","document_owner":"Ahmed Hassan","next_review_date":"2027-02-20","rollback_decision_owner":"Grace Moyo","point_of_no_return":"Sunday 11 April 2027, 18:00 – release of payments from the new platform","purpose":"To make sure the bank can return to the legacy system, with no loss of customer data, if the cutover cannot be completed safely.","objectives":"Restore the legacy system to its Friday close-of-business state\nReplay all transactions captured during the freeze\nReopen services on Monday on the legacy system","scope":"Legacy core banking restore\nInterface and channel re-pointing\nTransaction replay\nCustomer and staff communications","out_of_scope":"Rollback after the point of no return (fix-forward applies)","assumptions":"The Friday legacy backup has been verified\nThe legacy environment is kept intact until hypercare ends","constraints":"Rollback must finish before Monday 05:00\nRollback decision no later than Sunday 18:00","rollback_triggers":"Unexplained reconciliation differences\nCritical defect with no workaround\nPayment scheme connectivity failure\nSchedule slip beyond Monday 05:00","decision_criteria":"Can the issue be fixed before Monday 05:00?\nIs customer money at risk?\nIs the rollback still within its 8-hour duration?","decision_authority":"Executive sponsor decides on recommendation of the cutover board","decision_deadline":"Sunday 18:00","rollback_steps":"1\tStop all processing on the new platform\tTechnical lead\t15m\n2\tRestore the legacy database from the Friday backup\tInfrastructure\t2h\n3\tRe-point interfaces and channels to legacy\tIntegration\t2h\n4\tReplay transactions captured during the freeze\tOperations\t2h\n5\tReconcile legacy balances to Friday close\tFinance\t1h 30m\n6\tBusiness verification on legacy\tBusiness\t1h\n7\tReopen services and notify customers\tCommunications\t30m","estimated_rollback_duration":8,"systems_to_restore":"Legacy core banking\t1\tAhmed Hassan\nIntegration layer routes\t2\tAhmed Hassan\nCard authorisation routing\t3\tAhmed Hassan\nInternet and mobile banking back-ends\t4\tLinda Zhou","data_restore_approach":"Full restore of the legacy database from the verified Friday 20:00 backup, followed by replay of the transaction journal captured by the integration layer during the freeze.","transactions_during_cutover":"Card authorisations run in stand-in mode and are journalled, outgoing payments are held, branch transactions are not taken on Saturday.","reprocessing_approach":"Journalled card and payment transactions are replayed in time order against the restored legacy system and reconciled to the journal totals.","backups_required":"Legacy database\tFriday 20:00\tYes\nIntegration layer configuration\tFriday 18:00\tNot tested\nChannel configuration\tFriday 18:00\tNot tested","post_rollback_checks":"Legacy balances agree to Friday close plus replayed transactions\tOlivia Banda\tNot run\nSample customer checks by each business unit\tAmina Diallo\tNot run\nCard and payment test transactions\tLinda Zhou\tNot run","communication_plan":"Executive committee\tCutover rolled back, next steps\tOn the rollback decision\tDaniel Okafor\nRegulator\tFormal notice of the rollback\tWithin 2 hours\tNomvula Khumalo\nCustomers\tServices restored as normal\tBefore Monday opening\tLinda Zhou\nStaff\tBriefing on the legacy system\tBefore branches open\tAmina Diallo","customer_impact":"Customers see no change from before the weekend, held payments are released on Monday morning.","rollback_tested":false,"rollback_test_date":"2027-03-20","test_results":"Rollback will be rehearsed end to end during dress rehearsal 3.","risks_mitigations":"Backup cannot be restored\tNo route back\tBackup restore verified on Friday afternoon\tAhmed Hassan\nReplay misses transactions\tCustomer balances wrong\tJournal totals reconciled before and after replay\tOlivia Banda","roles_and_responsibilities":"Executive sponsor\tDecides on rollback\tGrace Moyo\nTechnical lead\tRuns the rollback steps\tAhmed Hassan\nFinancial controller\tSigns off the post-rollback reconciliation\tOlivia Banda","glossary":"Cutover\tThe move from the legacy core banking system to the new platform, from business freeze to go-live.\nCommand centre\tThe room and bridge line where the cutover is run, monitored and decided.\nGo/No-Go\tA formal checkpoint where the cutover board decides to continue, pause or roll back.\nPoint of no return\tThe last moment a rollback to the legacy system is possible without unacceptable data loss.\nDress rehearsal\tA full, timed run of the cutover in pre-production using the go-live runbook.\nHypercare\tThe period of heightened support after go-live.","appendices":"Cutover Strategy\tCUT-STR-001\nCutover Plan\tCUT-PLN-001","version_history":"0.1\t2026-09-05\tAhmed Hassan\tFirst draft\n0.3\t2026-11-02\tAhmed Hassan\tReplay approach added after Mock 2","related_documents":"Cutover Strategy\tCUT-STR-001\nCutover Plan\tCUT-PLN-001"}$j$),
